",null,{"className":"story-note","children":"電腦保持喚醒、Artemis 開啟且連接啟用，即可接收任務。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"connection-journey","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"journey-label","children":"從訊息，到本機成果"}],["$","blockquote",null,{"children":"「幫我檢查專案，整理今天的進度。」"}],["$","ol",null,{"children":[["$","li","一句話，交代任務",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"journey-number","aria-hidden":"true","children":1}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"一句話，交代任務"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"從你熟悉的通訊工具出發。"}]]}]]}],["$","li","在你的電腦上處理",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"journey-number","aria-hidden":"true","children":2}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"在你的電腦上處理"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"使用已授權的專案、檔案與工具。"}]]}]]}],["$","li","回到原來的對話",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"journey-number","aria-hidden":"true","children":3}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"回到原來的對話"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"接收進度、結果，再繼續聊。"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"journey-signature","children":"Artemis"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"im-groups","className":"group-story","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"section-shell","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"group-story-heading story-copy","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"IM 群組協作"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"同一個群組，\n各自的能力。"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"在現有的 Slack 頻道、飛書或 Lark 群組裡，每位成員連接自己的機器人與 Artemis。讓任務找到合適的人，也連接對方已授權的桌面能力。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"group-story-detail","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"group-points","children":[[["$","article","把工作交給指定成員",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"把工作交給指定成員"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"在群組裡 @ 對應機器人，或在 Artemis 中向群組成員分派任務。"}]]}],["$","article","在各自的範圍裡工作",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"在各自的範圍裡工作"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"每台電腦分別授權專案、資料夾、檔案與操作權限。"}]]}],["$","article","讓成果回到發起的地方",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"讓成果回到發起的地方"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"委派成果回到來源群組並提及請求者，接著完成後續工作。"}]]}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"story-note","children":"自動分派需完成機器人之間的授權與連通驗證；也可由人手動 @ 下一位機器人。"}]]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"product-frame","children":["$","$Ld",null,{"src":"/images/im-group-chat.png","alt":"Artemis 群組協作對話與成員面板","width":"1440","height":"850","priority":false,"sizes":"(max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 1200px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1080px","unoptimized":true}]}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"custom-agents","className":"section-shell feature-story agents-story","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"story-copy","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"自訂智慧體"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"把你的方法，\n交給熟悉的角色。"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"為研究、審閱或寫作建立專屬智慧體。職責和交付要求只需定義一次，就能在適用專案裡反覆呼叫。"}],"$Le"]}],"$Lf"]}],"$L10","$L11","$L12"]}],"$L13"]
